# Tanaris (44-44): the Gadgetzan errands left after Tanaris (43-43), and a pirate's ship schedule,
# for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/tanaris_44_44.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives and the places of mobs and objects from the game
# data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Tanaris, area 440). The quest list is
# section 6 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md. The other Tanaris quests are in Tanaris
# (43-43) and Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh (47-48).
# Tanaris Field Sampling (654) starts from the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source, the reward of Slake That
# Thirst (379, in Tanaris 43-43), and needs the Field Testing Kit from Into the Field (243, same
# guide). Ship Schedules (2876) starts from a Ship Schedule found in a Pirate's Footlocker, which
# the Southsea pirates of Lost Rigger Cove drop.
#
# The route: the flight from Brackenwall Village to Gadgetzan; one loop south and west of Gadgetzan
# to Sandsorrow Watch for the samples and the water; Lost Rigger Cove and Steamwheedle Port; the
# flight to Orgrimmar (training), where Feralas (45-46) starts.

guide Tanaris (44-44)
faction horde
levels 44 44
carry 1118 95033
leave 1118 2741 3520 95033
next Feralas (45-46)
# Left out: Overseas Delivery (95144, Innkeeper Fizzgrimble in Gadgetzan): it is handed in at
#   Powderfuse Port in the Riverglades, which Riverglades (40-43) leaves before the route first
#   comes to Gadgetzan, and no later guide goes back there (290 XP).

# Brackenwall Village to Gadgetzan -----------------------------------------------------------------

map Dustwallow Marsh
fly "Gadgetzan, Tanaris" npc 11899

# Gadgetzan ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Tanaris
accept 992
accept 2741
tip The Super Egg-O-Matic is the machine in Gadgetzan; its Hippogryph Egg is found in Feralas in a later guide, so keep the quest.
accept 654 at 53.2,31.2 "Just south of Gadgetzan, use the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source to start Tanaris Field Sampling"
tip Using the Power Source starts a two-hour timer: use it only once outside the town, ready to hunt. Each of you needs your own Power Source and Field Testing Kit (the kit from Into the Field).

# South and west of Gadgetzan: the samples, Sandsorrow Watch ---------------------------------------

do 654.3 bg mobs 5422 5423 at 53.9,33.8 icon get
do 654.2 bg mobs 5425 5426 8208 at 52.3,33.5 icon get
tip Use each Untested Sample you loot: the Field Testing Kit turns it into an Acceptable one.
do 654.1 mobs 5419 5420 at 50.0,37.5 icon get
tip The Glasshide basilisks also graze west toward Sandsorrow Watch.
do 992 at 39.0,29.0 icon use "Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the pool by Sandsorrow Watch"
tip The Sandfury trolls around the pool are level 42-44 elites: clear the nearest ones together, or tap the water and run.
do 654.2 mobs 5425 5426 8208 at 44.7,26.2 icon get
do 654.3 mobs 5422 5423 at 48.7,28.9 icon get

# Gadgetzan ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 654
tip Hand it in before the two hours run out, or the samples are lost.
turnin 992

# Lost Rigger Cove and Steamwheedle Port ------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride east to Lost Rigger Cove, the Southsea pirate camp on the coast" at 72.4,45.9 r 30
accept 2876 at 73.6,46.6 "Kill Southsea pirates until a Pirate's Footlocker drops, open it, and use the Ship Schedule inside"
tip Not every footlocker holds a schedule, and each of you needs one. Kregg Keelhaul, a level 47 rare in the cove, drops footlockers too.
turnin 2876
accept 3520
tip Screecher Spirits is done in Feralas in a later guide: keep Yeh'kinya's Bramble.
tip Security Chief Bilgewhizzle stands in Steamwheedle Port, up the coast to the north.

# Orgrimmar and the zeppelin ------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride back to Gadgetzan" at 51.6,26.6 r 30
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 7824
map Orgrimmar
train 3353 3352 3401 3344 5882 3324 6014
tip Paladins train in Undercity, druids in Thunder Bluff.
